s7:s5,i6:syl |- ( ( W e. Word ( { 1 } X. 2o ) /\ L e. Word Word ( { 1 } X. 2o ) ) -> ( encListB ` ( <" W "> ++ L ) ) = ( ( entries ` ( <" W "> ++ L ) ) ++ <" 2 "> ) )
