s29:s28:oveq2d |- ( ( W e. Word ( { 1 } X. 2o ) /\ L e. Word Word ( { 1 } X. 2o ) ) -> ( <" 4 "> ++ ( encListB ` L ) ) = ( <" 4 "> ++ ( ( entries ` L ) ++ <" 2 "> ) ) )
